        "TileImage": "$($repository 5288ef73-7819-4f32-a0dd-02a53e520612).Image",
        "Description": "47, This is Diana.\r\rYour targets are Piazza, a mercenary under Yate&apos;s command, has been hosting an insider meetup along with your other targets to secure a deal that leaks confidential ICA info. Albarez is an ICA traitor, is providing the intel to the meetup. Make sure that he doesn&apos;t live long enough to regret betraying the ICA. And of course Augusto Albarez has  his two proteges  (Duncan Lindsay &amp;  Spencer Brown) to continue the deal if anything is to happen... eliminate them.\r\rgood luck, 47.",
